SDV test1:

    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP:10+/-2ms, DL: 5+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Radar2 (SSP:10+/-2ms, DL: 5+/-2ms)

    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 10+/-2ms, AD: 5+/-2ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake2 (periodic 10+/-2ms, AD: 5+/-2ms)


    Component AEBS_controler 
    subscribe Radar2
    publish Brake
    publish Brake2
    service s1:
        triggered on Radar2 
        ExecTime 3+/-1ms